5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,The morning rush is becoming a physical hazard. We need to address the congestion.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Before we discuss solutions, we must understand the financial implications for the building.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I have noticed the same flats seem to claim the best spots repeatedly.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,We must avoid creating a system that breeds resentment among neighbours.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mio,,Who will actually maintain whatever system we choose? I worry about the workload.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, cost is important, but safety is immediate. We cannot ignore the shoving.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, if we cannot afford the fix, the problem remains. I need data.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,"@Shunichi, resentment is already there. We need to verify if the allocation is fair.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@George, fairness is subjective. I want to know the social cost of strict rules.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, I agree. I need to know the administrative burden of any new rule.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will look at the morning departures and the rain exposure.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will check the building ledger and the ward cycle park costs.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,I will review the five years of minutes and the sticker register.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will read the complaint log and the neighbouring block's account.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Mio,,I will examine the treasurer's file and the supplier's display frame trial.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
