34,2,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"I watched the mornings. Eleven bikes leave between seven and nine. Four times, someone had to shift another machine.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The ledger shows little capital work. The ward park costs 2,600 yen monthly, with fourteen households waiting.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,George,,The minutes show the same flats held covered spots for years. The sticker register shows varying bike counts.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,The complaint log has nine notes about leaning bikes. The neighbouring block had arrears and absenteeism.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Mio,,The treasurer spends three hours a month on cash. The display frame takes twenty seconds to load and needs greasing.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, if the ward park is full, we cannot just send people there. We need internal order.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, the ward park is a benchmark. If we charge, it must be competitive or justified.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,George,,"@Shunichi, the neighbouring block's failure suggests that charging can alienate people.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@George, yes. But the complaint log shows that doing nothing also fails. We need a middle ground.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, three hours a month is significant. Adding billing would double that. Who has time?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Asuka,,The rain exposure is bad past the downpipe. We need to prioritize dry spots for those who need them.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,The ledger is flat. Any new cost must be covered by a levy or income.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,George,,The sticker register shows some flats have three bikes. Equal claim is not equal need.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"If we make it a lottery, it feels random. If we make it paid, it feels exclusionary.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Mio,,The display frame is physically demanding. Shared racks might be easier to maintain than individual billing.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Asuka,,I prefer a system that reduces the morning shoving.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,I prefer a system that is financially sustainable.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,George,,I prefer a system that is perceived as fair.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,I prefer a system that keeps the peace.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Mio,,I prefer a system that does not burn out one person.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
